# Store and check out text files with LF line endings on every OS.
# Without this, Git for Windows (core.autocrlf=true) converts to CRLF on checkout
# and `prettier --check` (endOfLine: lf) reports every file as unformatted.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
